const about=$('data-copy');for(const [title,text] of [['Original-study ratings','Thorne, Hegarty & Hepper (2021), Study 3. This view uses only the Default prompt condition (n=45) from the supplied CSV, on a 1–7 importance scale. No other condition is pooled into the radial position. '+sourceMeta.screening],['Reading the views','Whole cloth preserves the selected Felt Studio V2 artwork, including its original backing and stitching. Its arrangement is the artist’s composition, not a new data encoding. Switch to Study map for the unchanged rating-based positions. Higher original-study ratings sit nearer the inner ring; lower ratings sit farther out. Exact anchors use r = 260 + (7 − mean) / 6 × 560. All original artworks have equal display frames. Their angle is fixed by feature number using the golden angle (137.507764°), starting at −90°. Angles and distances between tiles do not measure similarity. Tiles displaced to avoid overlap retain a dot at their true data position and a leader line. Standard deviations are included in the downloadable mapped data.'],['Art and participation','The 50 numbered inner images are the artist’s existing interpretations, shown with their complete square canvas. Colour, shape and stitch are artistic choices, not measurements. Every participant makes one fabric for exactly three feature IDs. Each saved fabric adds one selection to each of those three words. Selection counts describe this browser’s participation, never importance. They do not move original-study anchors.'],['The growing edge','Outer fabrics appear in submission order, 24 per edge group, with equal display space and preserved proportions. Outer placement says nothing about quality or importance. Hover, focus or select one fabric to see its three connections. Choose a word to see all fabrics that include it.'],['This is an art invitation','Choosing exactly three words is a rule of this artwork, not the original study procedure. There is no correct colour, shape or interpretation. Adding a piece requires an explicit action after preview. This local prototype stores contributions and drafts only in this browser; it does not share them with other visitors.']]){detailText('h3',title,about);detailText('p',text,about)}for(const [label,url] of [['Read the paper',sourceMeta.paper],['Source data on OSF',sourceMeta.source]]){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.textContent=label;a.target='_blank';a.rel='noopener';about.append(a)}

